comments.body:
I have tried with manually corrected minigraph.xml and warm-reboot happens as expected.

@Staphylo I think the best solution is to add a new column for speed in the port_config.ini for this SKU. This is because if we don't know port's bandwidth, assigning any default speed is probably a bad idea.

Also as earlier mentioned in the email, we also need to fix duplicate lane issue - lanes 128 is shared between two ports (Ethernet124 and Ethernet132).

@vaibhavhd I'm still looking into the issue you reported.
I've had to balance out a few tasks so I haven't made as much progress as I'd like.
I'll keep you posted.
